    "updated_at": "2016-06-06T07:37:54Z",
    "body": "I think if we make it clearer that \"Run the following substeps, but note the exception handling behavior below:\" catches the exception there's no problem here. E.g., \"Run the following substeps while catching any exceptions:\"\n",
